    "text": "THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice Under Section 07 My No.: ATU/LAND/04/DO/41. Land Ministry's No. : 4-3/2016/HA/89. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 07 of the land Acquisition Act 28 of 1964, the Government intends to acquire following land/servitude* which is require for a public purpose: Description of the land Servitude to be acquired:",
