    ],
    "text": "The allotment of land described below depicted in supplementary plan no. 37 of F.V.P. No. 86 prepared by Surveyor General situated at Thalahagama Village Divisional secretary's division of Athuraliya in the Gangabada Paththu North District of Matara. 1. Lot No. 807 Name of the land: Parana Pansal Waththa; Particulars of the land: Garden, Permanent Building; Claimant: Rev. Kirama Bodhirathana Chief Incumbent, Sri",
