    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing to appear before me at Athuraliya Divisional Secretary's on the 05th day of August 2019 at 1.00 p.m., and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 25th day of July 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
